{
  "description": "Evidence-bound criteria for the harness scorecard (A1 to A17). Read by tooling/scorecard.js. Fixture criteria carry weight 8 per aspect and the operational criterion weight 2, so an aspect proven only by fixtures scores at most 8, and 9 or 10 need operational evidence. A criterion whose suite does not exist yet stays UNKNOWN until its package lands. Policy frozen 2026-10-14, before evaluation.",
